What:		/sys/class/leds/<led>/zone_type
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	Marco Scardovi <scardracs@disroot.org>
Contact:	Denis Benato <denis.benato@linux.dev>
Description:	read
		Driver-defined string describing the physical topology of
		this lighting zone. Example values include ``generic``,
		``keyboard``, ``keyboard_per_key``, ``logo``, and ``lightbar``.
		When the driver does not set a zone string, the node reports
		``unknown``.
